"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"I’d choose the January 15 Aeroplan award via Beijing if arriving earlier matters most: it reaches Bangkok at 11:05 a.m. on January 17, 5 hours 45 minutes before the Taipei option, with the same reported 65,000 Aeroplan points. The tradeoff is a longer journey and a longer connection. Neither award’s fee quote has a stated scope, so treat it as a source quote—not a per-person or trip total.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J3@2027-01-15T11:00-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T11:05\",\"n\":\"Earlier arrival via Beijing\",\"v\":\"This Aeroplan economy award departs SFO at 11:00 a.m. January 15 and arrives BKK at 11:05 a.m. January 17, via Beijing on TG and UA. It reports 65,000 Aeroplan points and a CAD 102.00 award-tax quote of unknown scope. The journey takes 33 hours 5 minutes, including an 805-minute connection in Beijing. The award supports the requested one traveler in the search evidence and reports 9 seats; this is not a guarantee of current availability. Leg-by-leg cabins were not reported.\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J13@2027-01-15T23:30-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T16:50\",\"n\":\"Later arrival via Taipei\",\"v\":\"This Aeroplan economy award departs SFO at 11:30 p.m. January 15 and arrives BKK at 4:50 p.m. January 17, via Taipei on BR and TG. It also reports 65,000 Aeroplan points, with a CAD 116.50 award-tax quote of unknown scope. It takes 26 hours 20 minutes—6 hours 45 minutes less elapsed time than the Beijing option—and its Taipei connection is 495 minutes. Its downside is arriving later; the search reports 1 seat and award support for the requested one traveler, not guaranteed current availability. Leg-by-leg cabins were not reported.\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T03\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"The Beijing option’s CAD quote is CAD 14.50 lower than the Taipei option’s, but both scopes are unknown, so this is only a raw quote comparison, not a like-for-like cost or savings claim. Both awards report the same points in the same program. For a cash baseline, the search also shows a two-stop United/ANA itinerary; its quote scope is likewise unstated.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C3@2027-01-15T08:51-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash baseline via LAX and NRT\",\"v\":\"The January 15 SFO–LAX–NRT–BKK itinerary departs at 8:51 a.m. and arrives at 10:50 p.m. January 16, taking 22 hours 59 minutes. The source quote is USD 456.00, with unknown scope; it is not established as a per-traveler or total-party amount. The search reports one returned traveler for this cash result, which does not establish award support. Compare it as a separate cash baseline, not as a fully scoped total against either points award.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"The search results are partial, and availability and prices may change; confirm current details with the booking provider before booking.\"}]}"
